  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "English: Libmem.NET 2.5.0 adds ScanManager.TryDataScan/TryPatternScan/TrySigScan and MemoryManager.TryRead/TryWrite, retaining native miss or partial-transfer information while preserving existing APIs. Harden local HookHandle.Remove with a trampoline-readability preflight and test partial VMT reset and retry. Native libmem remains pinned; Windows x64/x86 and .NET 8 only. Hook removal is not atomic; AnyCPU, ARM64 and cross-bitness remain unsupported. 中文：Libmem.NET 2.5.0 新增 ScanManager 的三个 Try 扫描接口和 MemoryManager.TryRead/TryWrite，保留原有 API 语义并明确未命中及部分传输结果。加强本进程 HookHandle.Remove 对 trampoline 可读性的检查，覆盖 VMT 部分恢复及重试；固定 native libmem，仍仅支持 Windows x64/x86 与 .NET 8。Hook 卸载非原子操作，不支持 AnyCPU、ARM64 或跨位数。Full notes / 完整说明: https://github.com/CardResearchLab/Libmem.NET/blob/main/docs/releases/v2.5.0.md",
